{"parse":{"title":"Lunacy's Lure","pageid":430085,"revid":2045101,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Lunacy&#39;s Lure</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5a/Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185656\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Lunacy&#39;s Lure\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5a/Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185656\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5a/Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185656 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5a/Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20260115185656 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Lunacy&#39;s Lure\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Lunacy&#39;s Lure.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When triggering <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>Gravity Interference</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Gravity Ripple</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unleashing Elemental Skill Eternal Tides, Columbina will summon Gravity Ripple.<br />Gravity Ripple will follow the current active character on the field, while continuously dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>AoE Hydro DMG</b></span> to surrounding opponents.<br /><br />Additionally, while Gravity Ripple is on the field, and nearby party members trigger Lunar reactions or inflict Lunar Reaction DMG, Columbina will gain the New Moon's Omen effect for 2s, continuously accumulating Gravity. 20 Gravity can be accumulated every 2s.<br />You can have up to 60 Gravity, and it will be removed when the duration of Gravity Ripple ends.<br />Once Gravity is accumulated to its limit, a special Gravity Interference will be triggered. Different effects will be triggered depending on the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina. If the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina is:<br /><ul><ul><li> Lunar-Charged: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG. </li><li> Lunar-Bloom: Gravity Interference will fire 5 Moondew Sigils at surrounding opponents, dealing <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG.</li><li> Lunar-Crystallize: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Crystallize DMG.</li></ul></ul></span></span></span>, Columbina gains the Lunacy effect, increasing her <a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a> by 5% for 10s. This effect can be stacked up to 3 times.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Lunacy's Lure</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunacy%2527s_Lure%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Lunacy's Lure</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">月亮诱发的疯狂</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yuèliàng Yòufā de Fēngkuáng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Moon-Induced Madness</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">月亮誘發的瘋狂</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Yuèliàng Yòufā de Fēngkuáng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">月が呼んだ狂気</span><br /><small><i>Tsuki ga Yonda Kyouki</i></small></td><td>Moon-Called Madness</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">달의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">유혹</span><br /><small><i>Dar-ui Yuhok</i></small></td><td>Moon's Temptation</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Delirio sel<span lang=\"es\">é</span>nico</td><td>Selenic Delirium</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Attrait lunatique</td><td>Lunatic Lure</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Зов</span> <span lang=\"ru\">лунного</span> <span lang=\"ru\">безумия</span><br /><small><i>Zov lunnogo bezumiya</i></small></td><td>Lunar Madness' Call</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Lunacy's Lure</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Cuồng Bạo Của Mặt Trăng</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Mondbedingter Wahnsinn</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Lunacy's Lure</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Mania Lunar</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Ay<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n Delirten <span lang=\"tr\">Ç</span>a<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>r<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>s<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Delirio lunare</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLunacy%2527s_Lure%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_IV\" title=\"Version/Luna IV\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Lunacy%27s_Lure/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+IV%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Lunacy%27s+Lure\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding: