-width-down/60?cb=20260115185654\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlit_Melancholy\" title=\"Moonlit Melancholy\">Moonlit Melancholy</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>1st Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lunacy%27s_Lure\" title=\"Lunacy&#39;s Lure\"><img alt=\"Talent Lunacy&#39;s Lure\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Lunacy&#39;s Lure.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5a/Talent_Lunacy%27s_Lure.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260115185656\" /></a></span><br /><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Lunacy's Lure</strong></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>4th Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Law_of_the_New_Moon\" title=\"Law of the New Moon\"><img alt=\"Talent Law of the New Moon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Law of the New Moon.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Law_of_the_New_Moon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/37/Talent_Law_of_the_New_Moon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20260115185658\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Law_of_the_New_Moon\" title=\"Law of the New Moon\">Law of the New Moon</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Moonsign Benediction </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight,_Lent_Unto_You\" title=\"Moonlight, Lent Unto You